   "subject": "Comparison of FA",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Good afternoon,<div><br></div><div>I apologize for the relatively simple question. I am working on FA comparisons between genotypes, and I am wondering what the best way to glean statistical significance between groups would be?</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for any guidance,</div><div><br></div><div>Elizabeth </div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
