   "subject": "Re: [geomorph-r-package] Comparison of FA",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Are you testing for a difference in FA or in just the magnitude of FA? One complication that often arises when comparing levels of FA is that measurement error might not be equal across groups (I&#39;ve found that it isn&#39;t owing to greater digitizing error in the first group measured...). You might want to start by comparing measurement error across groups.<br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Fri, Jul 5, 2019 at 10:58 AM Adams, Dean [G COL] &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dca...@iastate.edu</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
